  "raw_result": "\n\nCarpe Diem means \"seize the day\" in English. In Chinese, it can be translated as 抓住今天 (zhuā zhù jīntiān). This phrase encourages people to make the most of the present moment and not to put off until tomorrow what can be done today. It is often used to express the idea that life is short and unpredictable, and that we should not waste our time on trivial matters or procrastination. Instead, we should seize opportunities and live our lives to the fullest.",
  "result": "抓住每一天，即 Carpe Diem 的意思是\"抓住每一天\"，在中文中可以翻译为\"抓住每一天，不要放过\"。这是一个古老的哲学概念，意味着人们应该尽可能地享受生活，不要浪费时间。"
